  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Hexwarp Thrallband",
    "summary": "These parts of the battlefield are in the Flow of Magic of your army:\n\n- your deployment zone, always\n- No Man's Land, if you hold half or more of the [objective markers](vsdata:core-rule/objectives) in it as a phase begins, for the rest of that phase\n- the deployment zone of your opponent, if you hold half or more of the objective markers in it as a phase begins, for the rest of that phase\n\nWhenever one of your **THOUSAND SONS** models makes a Psychic Attack, it can re-roll 1s to [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls). While that model is wholly within the Flow of Magic of your army, its Psychic Attacks get +1 to Wound instead.",
